title: EMR Connect › Page › The Action required line
route: /emr
intro: One banner line under the header names what needs a person on this page, with one button for the first item. It lists only the systems and fields at the sites in view. When nothing needs a person there is no banner. The line follows the page: fix the system, map the fields or resume the agent, and it changes or goes.
dir: TD
also: Order of importance: a system that Needs attention, a Disconnected system, fields waiting for a mapping, a paused Reader or Navigator. Only the first has a button here; the rest follow after 'Also:' as plain words, and each has its own button further down the page. Reader and Navigator are the two agents this page uses.
---
start s1 "The page loads, or something changes on it"
decision q1 "Does anything need a person?"
end e0 "No banner\nThe health card says 'all systems answering'"

group gItems "What is checked, in this order"
  decision q2 "A system that Needs attention?"
  screen i1 "'Action required: Billing system needs attention.'\nButton 'Fix'"
  decision q3 "A system that is Disconnected?"
  screen i2 "'Action required: {name} is disconnected.'\nButton 'Reconnect'"
  decision q4 "Fields waiting for a mapping, on a system in view?\n(both start on Site B's record, so a Site A view does not list them)"
  screen i3 "'Action required: 2 fields need a mapping, so New Case leaves them blank.'\nButton 'Map field' for the first waiting field"
  decision q5 "Reader or Navigator paused in Settings?"
  screen i4 "'Action required: Reader is paused, so syncs and new connections wait.'\nLink 'Open Settings'"
endgroup

process p1 "Several items: the first is the line, the others follow after 'Also:'\n'Action required: Billing system needs attention. Also: 2 fields need a mapping, so New Case leaves them blank.'"
process p2 "Only one banner ever shows\nIt is the only banner on the page"

click k1 "Click the banner's button"
decision q6 "Which button?"
process b1 "'Fix': starts the Fix steps\nA paused Navigator waits, 'Ask before acting' asks first"
process b2 "'Reconnect': starts the connection test\nA paused Navigator waits, 'Ask before acting' asks first"
process b3 "'Map field': opens the Map pop-up for the first waiting field"
process b4 "'Open Settings': goes to Settings, where the agent is resumed"

goto g1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Problems › Fix a system that needs attention"
goto g2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Manage › Reconnect a system"
goto g3 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Needs a mapping › Map a field"
goto g4 "Continues in: Settings › Pause › Pause one agent, resume all"
goto g5 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Sync › When an agent is paused or asks first"

s1 --> q1
q1 -->|No| e0
q1 -->|Yes| q2
q2 -->|Yes| i1
q2 -->|No| q3
q3 -->|Yes| i2
q3 -->|No| q4
q4 -->|Yes| i3
q4 -->|No| q5
q5 -->|Yes| i4
i1 & i2 & i3 & i4 --> p1
p1 -.-> p2
i1 & i2 & i3 & i4 --> k1 --> q6
q6 -->|Fix| b1 --> g1
q6 -->|Reconnect| b2 --> g2
q6 -->|Map field| b3 --> g3
q6 -->|Open Settings| b4 --> g4
b1 & b2 -.-> g5
